sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Student as 学生小程序
  participant API as workflow API
  participant Storage as 对象存储
  participant Teacher as 管理端审批人
  participant Audit as 审计服务
  Student->>API: 创建事务申请草稿
  Student->>API: 上传附件
  API->>Storage: 保存附件对象
  Student->>API: 提交申请
  API->>Audit: 记录提交动作
  Teacher->>API: 查看申请详情
  Teacher->>API: 审批通过/驳回/转线下
  API->>Audit: 记录审批动作
  API-->>Student: 返回最新状态与意见
